{"code":"PK07","wikidata":"Q123537262","wikipedia":{"en":"Pak Kret Bypass MRT station","th":"สถานีเลี่ยงเมืองปากเกร็ด"},"summary":{"en":"Pak Kret Bypass station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. Located on Chaeng Watthana Road, near Pak Kret Bypass Road (Highway 3105) in Pak Kret district, Nonthaburi province, the station has four exits. It opened on 21 November 2023 as part of trial operations on the entire Pink Line.","th":"สถานีเลี่ยงเมืองปากเกร็ด เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนแจ้งวัฒนะในพื้นที่อำเภอปากเกร็ด จังหวัดนนทบุรี"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Pak_Kret_Bypass_Station_20231125-4.jp